<li><span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; ">‘<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt470" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver">...</span>’</span> <i lang="nl"><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/zogenaamdfunctie#Dutch" title="wikt:zogenaamdfunctie" class="extiw">zogenaamdfunctie</a></i> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scare_quotes" title="Scare quotes">scare quotes</a>)<sup about="#mwt471" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-nl-1_48-1" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{"name":"nl-1"}}'><a href="#cite_note-nl-1-48" id="mwAzU"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAzY"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAzc">[</span>40<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAzg">]</span></span></a></sup></li></ul>

</div></td>
<td id="mwAzk">
<ul id="mwAzo"><li id="mwAzs">Double citation marks are only used in literal citations</li>
<li id="mwAzw">The sequence when using primary and secondary level is a recommendation, not a rule.</li></ul></td></tr>
