<td id="mwBYA">Occasionally, other symbols, such as <span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt780" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBYE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"“{{color|silver|...}}”"}},"i":0}}]}'>“<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt781" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver">...</span>”</span>, are used stylistically. Quotes are almost always followed by particle <span lang="ja" about="#mwt782" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBYI" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"ja"},"2":{"wt":"と"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/と#Japanese" title="wikt:と" class="extiw">と</a></span>.</td></tr>
