<td id="mwBjU"><span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt872" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBjY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"{{large|{{lang|jbo|lu “{{color|silver|...}}” li’u}}}}"}},"i":0}}]}'><span style="font-size:120%"><span title="Lojban-language text"><i lang="jbo">lu “<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt873" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver">...</span>” li’u</i></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:Articles_containing_Lojban-language_text"/></span></span></td>
<td id="mwBjc"></td>
<td id="mwBjg"></td>
<td id="mwBjk"></td>
<td id="mwBjo">Double quotes are not officially named in Lojban, but sometimes called <i lang="jbo" about="#mwt874" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBjs" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"jbo"},"2":{"wt":"lubu"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Appendix:Lojban/lubu#Lojban" title="wikt:Appendix:Lojban/lubu" class="extiw">lubu</a></i>, following the same pattern as vowel letters, e.g. ⟨a⟩<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBjw"> </span>=<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwBj0"> </span><i lang="jbo" about="#mwt875" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBj4" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"jbo"},"2":{"wt":"abu"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Appendix:Lojban/abu#Lojban" title="wikt:Appendix:Lojban/abu" class="extiw">abu</a></i></td>
<td id="mwBj8">Lojban uses the words <i lang="jbo" about="#mwt876" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBkA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"jbo"},"2":{"wt":"lu"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Appendix:Lojban/lu#Lojban" title="wikt:Appendix:Lojban/lu" class="extiw">lu</a></i> and <i lang="jbo" about="#mwt877" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBkE" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"jbo"},"2":{"wt":"li’u"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Appendix:Lojban/li’u#Lojban" title="wikt:Appendix:Lojban/li’u" class="extiw">li’u</a></i>, rather than punctuation, to surround quotes of grammatically correct Lojban.<sup about="#mwt881" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-80" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-80"}}'><a href="#cite_note-80" id="mwBkI"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBkM"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBkQ">[</span>63<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBkU">]</span></span></a></sup> Double quotes can also be used for aesthetic purposes. Non-Lojban text may be quoted using <i lang="jbo" about="#mwt878" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwBkY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"wikt-lang","href":"./Template:Wikt-lang"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"jbo"},"2":{"wt":"zoi"}},"i":0}}]}'><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Appendix:Lojban/zoi#Lojban" title="wikt:Appendix:Lojban/zoi" class="extiw">zoi</a></i>.<sup about="#mwt884" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-81" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-81"}}'><a href="#cite_note-81" id="mwBkc"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwBkg"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBkk">[</span>64<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwBko">]</span></span></a></sup></td></tr>
