es-verbal_779087.html&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AQuotation+mark" class="Z3988" id="mwENo"></span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_French-language_sources_(fr)" id="mwENs"/></span></li>
