ass="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEf4">...</span>”</span></li>
<li id="mwEf8"><span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt293" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEgA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"’{{color|silver|...}}’"}},"i":0}}]}'>’<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt294" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEgE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEgI">...</span>’</span> and <span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt295" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEgM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"‘{{color|silver|...}}’"}},"i":0}}]}'>‘<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt296" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEgQ" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEgU">...</span>’</span> are sometimes written as <span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt297" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEgY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"&apos;{{color|silver|...}}&apos;"}},"i":0}}]}'>'<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt298" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEgc" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEgg">...</span>'</span>, <span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt299" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEgk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"‘{{color|silver|...}}’"}},"i":0}}]}'>‘<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt300" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEgo" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEgs">...</span>’</span> or <span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt301" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEgw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"‛{{color|silver|...}}’"}},"i":0}}]}'>‛<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt302" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEg0" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEg4">...</span>’</span></li>
<li id="mwEg8">There is some limited use of alternative secondary quotation marks:  <span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt303" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEhA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"’{{color|silver|...}}‘"}},"i":0}}]}'>’<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt304" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEhE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEhI">...</span>‘</span>; <span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt305" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEhM" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":",{{color|silver|...}}‘"}},"i":0}}]}'>,<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt306" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEhQ" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEhU">...</span>‘</span>; <span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt307" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEhY" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"’{{color|silver|...}}’"}},"i":0}}]}'>’<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt308" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEhc" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEhg">...</span>’</span>; <span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt309" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEhk" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":",{{color|silver|...}}’"}},"i":0}}]}'>,<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt310" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEho" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEhs">...</span>’</span>; <span class="serif-fonts" style="font-family: 'Georgia Pro', Georgia, 'DejaVu Serif', Times, 'Times New Roman', FreeSerif, 'DejaVu Math TeX', 'URW Bookman L', serif; " about="#mwt311" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEhw" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"serif","href":"./Template:Serif"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"‹{{color|silver|...}}›"}},"i":0}}]}'>‹<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt312" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEh0" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEh4">...</span>›</span>.</li></ul></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-zh-simple-1-37" id="cite_note-zh-simple-1-37" data-mw-footnote-number="30"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwEh8"><a href="#cite_ref-zh-simple-1_37-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwEiA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwEiE">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-zh-simple-1-37" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt349" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwEiI" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite web","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"url":{"wt":"https://www.yys.ac.cn/gfbz/shanghi/020.htm"},"title":{"wt":"Punctuation usage, Use of punctuation marks"},"date":{"wt":"13 December 1995"},"publisher":{"wt":"State Technical Supervision Bureau (for National Standards of People&apos;s Republic of China)"},"website":{"wt":"yys.ac.cn"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20060909152915/https://www.yys.ac.cn/gfbz/shanghi/020.htm"},"archive-date":{"wt":"9 September 2006"},"url-status":{"wt":"dead"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt349" id="mwEiM"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20060909152915/https://www.yys.ac.cn/gfbz/shanghi/020.htm" class="external text" id="mwEiQ">"Punctuation usage, Use of punctuation marks"</a>. <i id="mwEiU">yys.ac.cn</i>. State Technical Supervision Bureau (for National Standards of People's Republic of China). 13 December 1995. Archived from <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.yys.ac.cn/gfbz/shanghi/020.htm" class="external text" id="mwEiY">the original</a> on 9 September 2006.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=yys.ac.cn&amp;rft.atitle=Punctuation+usage%2C+Use+of+punctuation+marks&amp;rft.date=1995-12-13&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yys.ac.cn%2Fgfbz%2Fshanghi%2F020.htm&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AQuotation+mark" class="Z3988" about="#mwt349" id="mwEic"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-38" id="cite_note-38" data-mw-footnote-number="31"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwEig"><a href="#cite_ref-38" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwEik"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwEio">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-38" class="mw-reference-text reference-text">
<ul id="mwEis"><li id="mwEiw">Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese agree on the names of the vertical rectangle quotation marks (<span style="writing-mode:vertical-rl;" about="#mwt360" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEi0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Css-style","href":"./Template:Css-style"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"writing-mode:vertical-rl;"},"2":{"wt":"「{{color|silver|⋯}}」"}},"i":0}}]}'>「<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt361" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEi4" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEi8">⋯</span>」</span>and <span style="writing-mode:vertical-rl;" about="#mwt362" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEjA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Css-style","href":"./Template:Css-style"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"writing-mode:vertical-rl;"},"2":{"wt":"『{{color|silver|⋯}}』"}},"i":0}}]}'>『<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt363" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEjE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEjI">⋯</span>』</span>) but disagree on which pair being the primary one.</li>
<li id="mwEjM">In Simplified Chinese, rectangle quotation marks are only used in vertical texts. The horizontal rectangle quotation marks are not commonly used in Simplified Chinese, and in the rare cases where they are used, often the convention of Traditional Chinese is followed.</li></ul></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-zh-trad-40" id="cite_note-zh-trad-40" data-mw-footnote-number="32"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwEjQ"><a href="#cite_ref-zh-trad_40-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwEjU"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwEjY">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-zh-trad-40" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt381" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwEjc" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite web ","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"url":{"wt":"http://www.edu.tw/files/site_content/M0001/hau/c2.htm"},"title":{"wt":"《重訂標點符號手冊》修訂版（網路試用版）"},"publisher":{"wt":"Edu.tw"},"access-date":{"wt":"11 August 2015"},"url-status":{"wt":"dead"},"archiveurl":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20150810181025/http://www.edu.tw/FILES/SITE_CONTENT/M0001/HAU/c2.htm"},"archive-date":{"wt":"10 August 2015"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt381" id="mwEjg"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20150810181025/http://www.edu.tw/FILES/SITE_CONTENT/M0001/HAU/c2.htm" class="external text" id="mwEjk">"《重訂標點符號手冊》修訂版（網路試用版）"</a>. Edu.tw. Archived from <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.edu.tw/files/site_content/M0001/hau/c2.htm" class="external text" data-mw-original-href="http://www.edu.tw/files/site_content/M0001/hau/c2.htm" id="mwEjo">the original</a> on 10 August 2015<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwEjs">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwEjw">11 August</span> 2015</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E3%80%8A%E9%87%8D%E8%A8%82%E6%A8%99%E9%BB%9E%E7%AC%A6%E8%99%9F%E6%89%8B%E5%86%8A%E3%80%8B%E4%BF%AE%E8%A8%82%E7%89%88%EF%BC%88%E7%B6%B2%E8%B7%AF%E8%A9%A6%E7%94%A8%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89&amp;rft.pub=Edu.tw&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.edu.tw%2Ffiles%2Fsite_content%2FM0001%2Fhau%2Fc2.htm&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AQuotation+mark" class="Z3988" about="#mwt381" id="mwEj0"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-41" id="cite_note-41" data-mw-footnote-number="33"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwEj4"><a href="#cite_ref-41" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwEj8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwEkA">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-41" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt384" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwEkE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite web ","href":"./Template:Cite_web"},"params":{"url":{"wt":"http://resources.hkedcity.net/downloadResource.php?rid=534705586&amp;pid=2136454655"},"title":{"wt":"語文學習基礎知識"},"publisher":{"wt":"Resources.hkedcity.net"},"access-date":{"wt":"11 August 2015"},"archive-date":{"wt":"24 August 2012"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20120824161527/http://resources.hkedcity.net/downloadResource.php?rid=534705586&amp;pid=2136454655"},"url-status":{"wt":"live"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt384" id="mwEkI"><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://resources.hkedcity.net/downloadResource.php?rid=534705586&amp;pid=2136454655" class="external text" id="mwEkM">"語文學習基礎知識"</a>. Resources.hkedcity.net. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20120824161527/http://resources.hkedcity.net/downloadResource.php?rid=534705586&amp;pid=2136454655" class="external text" id="mwEkQ">Archived</a> from the original on 24 August 2012<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwEkU">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwEkY">11 August</span> 2015</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=%E8%AA%9E%E6%96%87%E5%AD%B8%E7%BF%92%E5%9F%BA%E7%A4%8E%E7%9F%A5%E8%AD%98&amp;rft.pub=Resources.hkedcity.net&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fresources.hkedcity.net%2FdownloadResource.php%3Frid%3D534705586%26pid%3D2136454655&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AQuotation+mark" class="Z3988" about="#mwt384" id="mwEkc"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-42" id="cite_note-42" data-mw-footnote-number="34"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwEkg"><a href="#cite_ref-42" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwEkk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwEko">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-42" class="mw-reference-text reference-text">
<ul id="mwEks"><li id="mwEkw">Simplified Chinese and Traditional Chinese agree on the names of the vertical rectangle quotation marks (<span style="writing-mode:vertical-rl;" about="#mwt395" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwEk0" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Css-style","href":"./Template:Css-style"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"writing-mode:vertical-rl;"},"2":{"wt":"「{{color|silver|⋯}}」"}},"i":0}}]}'>「<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt396" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwEk4" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwEk8">⋯</span>」</span>and <span style="writing-mode:vertical-rl;" about="#mwt397" typeof="mw:Transclusion" id="mwElA" data-mw='{"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Css-style","href":"./Template:Css-style"},"params":{"1":{"wt":"writing-mode:vertical-rl;"},"2":{"wt":"『{{color|silver|⋯}}』"}},"i":0}}]}'>『<link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239334494" about="#mwt398" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwElE" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Template:Color/styles.css"}}'/><span class="tmp-color" style="color:silver" id="mwElI">⋯</span>』</span>) but disagree on which pair being the primary one.</li>
<li id="mwElM">In Traditional Chinese, curly quotation marks are not commonly used, and in the rare cases where they are used, often the convention of Simplified Chinese is followed.</li></ul></span></li>
